  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPA Rapid Response and Social Safety for Local Actors in repression Zimbabwe 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall goal
To provide support and safety for victims under danger or threat due to civic repression and ongoing retribution in Zimbabwe.
Objectives
-	To provide, rescue identified victims of escalating civic repression, pre and post &#x2013;election political violence by removing them from dangerous and threating situations.

-	To provide assessment documentation and information dissemination for the preparation of situation rooms.

-	To build the capacity of women, 65 women&#x2019;s organisations, journalists, and community human rights defenders&#x2019; response mechanisms to pre and post-election violence. 
Target groups: Victims of the protests, CSOs, election observers &amp; monitors, voter education mobilisers, families and relatives of members of targeted human rights defenders, journalists and members of the community perceived to be opposition supporters</narrative>
  </description>
